    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motorhome: Traveling America \u2013 Your Adventure Starts Here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the Road</strong> \u2013 where the journey becomes your home, and every turn brings a new story! Explore the vast landscapes of America: from snow-capped peaks to mysterious canyons, from bustling landmarks to serene wilderness. Your motorhome is your ticket to a world of discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/6d384436ce0a2829f75178490f828881.poster.avif?t=1750688802\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/6d384436ce0a2829f75178490f828881.webm?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/6d384436ce0a2829f75178490f828881.mp4?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search, Explore, Be Amazed!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of <strong>national parks</strong>, <strong>ski resorts</strong>, and <strong>majestic deserts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>challenging puzzles</strong>, play <strong>engaging mini-games</strong>, and collect <strong>unique souvenirs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the <strong>sly raccoon</strong> \u2013 he knows where the most valuable treasures are hidden!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/1754673bdd18d101cc7ce0bd95271ebb.poster.avif?t=1750688802\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/1754673bdd18d101cc7ce0bd95271ebb.webm?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/1754673bdd18d101cc7ce0bd95271ebb.mp4?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collector\u2019s Edition \u2013 Even More Adventures!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 bonus locations</strong> \u2013 new challenges and hidden objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 mini-games + 12 puzzles</strong> \u2013 for those who love a good brain teaser.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive souvenirs</strong> \u2013 20 special items to commemorate your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wallpapers and soundtrack</strong> \u2013 so the adventure stays with you even after the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for the trip of a lifetime?</strong> Get behind the wheel \u2013 <strong>breathtaking scenery, mysteries, and endless fun await!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motorhome: Traveling America \u2013 Your Adventure Starts Here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the Road</strong> \u2013 where the journey becomes your home, and every turn brings a new story! Explore the vast landscapes of America: from snow-capped peaks to mysterious canyons, from bustling landmarks to serene wilderness. Your motorhome is your ticket to a world of discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/6d384436ce0a2829f75178490f828881.poster.avif?t=1750688802\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/6d384436ce0a2829f75178490f828881.webm?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/6d384436ce0a2829f75178490f828881.mp4?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search, Explore, Be Amazed!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of <strong>national parks</strong>, <strong>ski resorts</strong>, and <strong>majestic deserts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>challenging puzzles</strong>, play <strong>engaging mini-games</strong>, and collect <strong>unique souvenirs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the <strong>sly raccoon</strong> \u2013 he knows where the most valuable treasures are hidden!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/1754673bdd18d101cc7ce0bd95271ebb.poster.avif?t=1750688802\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/1754673bdd18d101cc7ce0bd95271ebb.webm?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480690/extras/1754673bdd18d101cc7ce0bd95271ebb.mp4?t=1750688802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collector\u2019s Edition \u2013 Even More Adventures!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 bonus locations</strong> \u2013 new challenges and hidden objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 mini-games + 12 puzzles</strong> \u2013 for those who love a good brain teaser.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive souvenirs</strong> \u2013 20 special items to commemorate your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wallpapers and soundtrack</strong> \u2013 so the adventure stays with you even after the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for the trip of a lifetime?</strong> Get behind the wheel \u2013 <strong>breathtaking scenery, mysteries, and endless fun await!</strong></p>",
